<figure id="A11.T12" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 12: </span>
Evaluation prompt for the T2T task.
</figcaption>
<div id="A11.T12.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:393.5pt;height:524.6pt;vertical-align:-259.9pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-9.7pt,12.9pt) scale(0.953233664496217,0.953233664496217) ;">
<table id="A11.T12.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A11.T12.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A11.T12.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_tt">
<span id="A11.T12.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A11.T12.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A11.T12.2.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_underline ltx_font_bold">Prompt for Text-to-Text Task</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A11.T12.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A11.T12.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A11.T12.2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A11.T12.2.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A11.T12.2.1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_smallcaps" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFFF00;">System Prompt<span id="A11.T12.2.1.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright">:</span></span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A11.T12.2.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A11.T12.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A11.T12.2.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A11.T12.2.1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">You are a helpful assistant that scores other AI assistants based on a given
criteria and the quality of their answers to the user question. You will be given the
one user prompt ([[PROMPT]]) and two responses ([[RESPONSE A]] and [[RESPONSE B]]) generated by two models.</span>
<span id="A11.T12.2.1.3.1.1.2" class="ltx_p">Rate the quality of the AI assistant’s response(s) according to the following criteria:</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A11.T12.2.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A11.T12.2.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A11.T12.2.1.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
