</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A11.T12.2.1.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A11.T12.2.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A11.T12.2.1.5.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A11.T12.2.1.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Your score should reflect the
quality of the AI assistant’s response(s) with respect to the specific criteria above, ignoring
other aspects of the answer (such as overall quality), and should agree with the score provided
by a reasonable human evaluator.</span>
<span id="A11.T12.2.1.5.1.1.2" class="ltx_p">The order of the responses is random, and you must avoid
letting the order bias your answer. Be as objective as possible in your evaluation.</span>
<span id="A11.T12.2.1.5.1.1.3" class="ltx_p">Begin your evaluation by carefully analyzing the evaluation criteria and the response. After providing your explanation, please make a decision. After providing your explanation, output your final verdict by strictly following this format: “[[A]” if response A is better, “[[B]” if response B is better.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A11.T12.2.1.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A11.T12.2.1.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
