<td id="A11.T12.2.1.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A11.T12.2.1.7.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A11.T12.2.1.7.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">You are a helpful assistant that scores other AI assistants based on a given
criteria and the quality of their answers to the user question. You will be given the
one user prompt ([[PROMPT]]) and two responses ([[RESPONSE A]] and [[RESPONSE B]]) generated by two models.</span>
<span id="A11.T12.2.1.7.1.1.2" class="ltx_p">Rate the quality of the AI assistant’s response(s) according to the following criteria:</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A11.T12.2.1.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A11.T12.2.1.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
