by a reasonable human evaluator.</span>
<span id="A11.T16.2.1.9.1.1.2" class="ltx_p">The order of the responses is random, and you must avoid
letting the order bias your answer. Be as objective as possible in your evaluation.</span>
<span id="A11.T16.2.1.9.1.1.3" class="ltx_p">Begin your evaluation by carefully analyzing the evaluation criteria and the response.
After providing your explanation, please make a decision. After providing your explanation, output your final verdict by strictly following this format:
“[[A]” if response A is better, “[[B]” if response B is better, “[[C]” means you cannot decide which one is better (or they are equal).
However, please try to avoid giving a “tie” preference and be as decisive as possible.</span>
