<span id="A11.T19.2.1.7.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">As a professional “Text-to-3D” quality inspector, your task is to score other AI assistants based on a given criteria and the quality of their answers to a text-to-3D generation task. You will be given a user instruction ([[PROMPT]]) and two responses ([[RESPONSE A]] and [[RESPONSE B]]), each presenting the rendering of a 3D object.</span>
<span id="A11.T19.2.1.7.1.1.2" class="ltx_p">Rate the quality of the AI assistant’s response(s) according to the following criteria:</span>
</span></td></tr>
